#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
session-ledger — Local Claude and Codex session transcript database.

Harvests local JSONL transcripts into a SQLite database with FTS5
full-text search. Zero dependencies — stdlib only.

Usage:
    ledger init                     Create/migrate database
    ledger harvest [options]        Ingest transcripts
    ledger search <query> [opts]    Full-text search
    ledger sessions [list|show]     Browse sessions
    ledger files [hot|trail]        File operation tracking
    ledger stats [overview|daily]   Usage statistics
    ledger status                   Database health
    ledger export [opts]            JSON export of shared records
    ledger query <sql>              Raw SQL access

Config via environment:
    LEDGER_DB       Database path (default: ~/.claude/session-ledger.db)
    LEDGER_CLAUDE   Claude config dir (default: ~/.claude)
    LEDGER_PROJECT  Project dir for session discovery (default: all projects)
    LEDGER_CODEX    Codex root dir (default: ~/.codex)
    LEDGER_VAULT    Obsidian vault root (unset means vault harvest is unavailable)

🌐 Victor Valentine Romo · victorvalentineromo.com · scalewithsearch.com
"""

